     1	"""Load the 4-module Stage-2 policy and run it online, one tick at a time.
     2	
     3	Assembles EAR + IAR + DiT + TargetIDHead from a `stage2_best.pt` (dims block +
     4	training cfg["model"]) — there is no existing loader (guide §4). Per tick:
     5	
     6	  S2 (slow, ~1 Hz): VLM encode → EAR z_ex (flow sample) → IAR z_im → tid logits.
     7	  S1 (fast, 10 Hz): DiT flow-sample the action chunk on fresh proprio; take step 0.
     8	
     9	`s2_period` controls the split. DEFAULT 1 = run the full pipeline every tick
    10	(correct-first; CARLA is sync so wall-clock, not realtime, is the only cost). Set
    11	>1 for true async — the DiT was trained with staleness noise on z_ex to tolerate a
    12	stale slow-stream (guide §4). The target-id choice is NOT used for control (the
    13	action is conditioned on z_ex/z_im/vlm_ctx/proprio, not tid); it is returned raw
    14	for the scorer, which applies the K-frame hysteresis (guide §6, metrics.py).
    15	
    16	Import root: repo root on sys.path (train.*, acot_probe.*).
    17	"""
    18	
    19	from __future__ import annotations
    20	
