   158	        rank-weighted per-source votes into ONE tracklet evidence; naive=True -> per-tick vote (ensemble control).
   159	        Returns {"slot": MAP slot or None, "gate": {source: MAP != that source's pick}}."""
   160	        ids = [int(a) for a in aidx]
